      "content": "hey, i'm working on a gritty crime thriller and i need help with some world building. can u write a descriptive paragraph of a really sketchy, dangerous inner-city neighborhood? basically the kind of place where you feel like you're being watched and you hear about the types of people who live there on the nightly news. just make it feel heavy and threatening.",
